%% Sequence: assignment run, review and approval per Block (commit)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Mg as Manager
  participant C as AssignmentController
  participant A as AssignmentService
  participant F as EngineFactory
  participant En as AssignmentEngine
  participant I as Inventory (INV)
  participant B as Billing (BIL)
  participant R2 as Round2Offers
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Mg->>C: POST /assignment-runs {termId, dryRun}
  C->>A: start(term, dryRun)
  alt real run before M3 or next-Term requests open
    A-->>Mg: 409 RENEWAL_FILING / RENEWAL_REQUESTS_OPEN
  else allowed
    A->>F: engine(term, matching snapshot)
    F->>I: assignableBeds(termId)
    A->>En: run(approved Applications, free Beds)
    En-->>A: proposal (fit scores, conflicts, waitlist)
    A->>DB: insert asg_run + asg_proposal_item
    A-->>Mg: run PROPOSED
  end
  Mg->>C: POST /assignment-runs/{id}/conflicts/{app}/resolve
  Mg->>C: POST /assignment-runs/{id}/approve {block}
  C->>A: approve(run, block)
  A->>DB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE the Block's Beds
  A->>DB: insert asg_allocation (one per Bed per Term, unique index)
  A->>B: issueBalance(allocation) per student
  A->>DB: Applications Allocated / Waitlisted
  A->>R2: offer(term, waitlisted)
  A-->>Mg: Block committed, students notified (results)
